{
  "id":"g7u-chapter-3","title":"第三章 整式及其加减",
  "packages":[
    {
      "id":"g7u-c3-expressions","subject":"数学","grade":7,"semester":"上册","textbookVersion":"北师大版","chapterId":"g7u-chapter-3","title":"用字母表示数与代数式求值","lessonId":"g7-upper-algebra","learningMode":"explanation","capabilityTags":["数量关系表达","代数式求值","字母意义"],
      "learningGuide":{"steps":["先说清字母代表什么量及其单位，再根据数量关系列代数式，例如每本 x 元、买 3 本，总价为 3x 元。","数字与字母相乘可省略乘号，把数字写在字母前；除法通常写成分数形式。","求值时把给定的数代入每处相同字母。代入负数时加括号，如 x = −2 时，x² = (−2)² = 4。","按运算顺序求值，再结合实际情境检查结果和单位。不同字母可以取相同的值，同一表达式中相同字母表示同一个数。"],"pitfalls":["‘比 x 的 3 倍多 2’是 3x + 2，不是 3(x + 2)。","‘x 的四分之一’是 x/4，不是 4x。","负数代入平方必须加括号，不能把 (−2)² 写成 −2²。"]},
      "questions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"字母意义","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"代数式 3x 表示什么？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3 与 x 的和"},{"id":"b","text":"3 与 x 的积"},{"id":"c","text":"3 除以 x"},{"id":"d","text":"x 的立方"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"数字与字母之间省略的是乘号，3x = 3 × x。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"每本练习本 5 元，买 n 本共需多少元？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"n + 5"},{"id":"b","text":"n/5"},{"id":"c","text":"5n"},{"id":"d","text":"5/n"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"总价 = 单价 × 数量，所以共需 5n 元。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"当 x = −2 时，2x + 5 的值是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"1"},{"id":"b","text":"9"},{"id":"c","text":"−9"},{"id":"d","text":"−1"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"代入得 2 × (−2) + 5 = −4 + 5 = 1。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"x 的四分之一可以表示为 4x。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"四分之一表示除以 4，应为 x/4；4x 表示 x 的 4 倍。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"当 x = 2、y = −1 时，3x − 2y 的值是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"4"},{"id":"b","text":"−8"},{"id":"c","text":"5"},{"id":"d","text":"8"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"3 × 2 − 2 × (−1) = 6 + 2 = 8。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"成人票每张 12 元，儿童票每张 6 元。买 a 张成人票和 b 张儿童票，共需多少元？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"18(a + b)"},{"id":"b","text":"12a + 6b"},{"id":"c","text":"12b + 6a"},{"id":"d","text":"18ab"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"成人票花费 12a 元，儿童票花费 6b 元，总价为两者之和。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"当 x = 3 时，下列求值结果中哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"x + 2 = 5"},{"id":"b","text":"2x = 6"},{"id":"c","text":"x² = 9"},{"id":"d","text":"x − 4 = 1"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","c"],"explanation":"代入 3 后依次得 5、6、9、−1，因此 A、B、C 正确。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"买 4 本每本 x 元的本子和 1 支 3 元的笔，付款 20 元且足够支付，应找回多少元？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"17 − 4x"},{"id":"b","text":"20 − 4x + 3"},{"id":"c","text":"20 − 7x"},{"id":"d","text":"4x − 17"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"找零 = 付款 − 总价 = 20 − (4x + 3) = 17 − 4x。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"字母意义","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"一个代数式中，只要两个字母不同，它们取的数值就一定不同。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"不同字母可以取相同的值，例如 x 和 y 都可以等于 2；是否不同要看题目条件。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"当 a = −2 时，下列求值结果中哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−a = 2"},{"id":"b","text":"a² = 4"},{"id":"c","text":"a³ = −8"},{"id":"d","text":"2a = 4"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","c"],"explanation":"a = −2 时，−a = 2，a² = 4，a³ = −8；2a = −4，不是 4。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ],
      "retestQuestions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"字母意义","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"代数式 y/5 表示什么？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"y 与 5 的积"},{"id":"b","text":"5 与 y 的商"},{"id":"c","text":"y 的 5 次方"},{"id":"d","text":"y 除以 5 的商"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"分子 y 是被除数，分母 5 是除数，因此表示 y ÷ 5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"每个文件夹 8 元，买 m 个共需多少元？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"8m"},{"id":"b","text":"8 + m"},{"id":"c","text":"m/8"},{"id":"d","text":"8/m"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"单价 8 元乘数量 m，总价为 8m 元。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"当 t = −3 时，4t + 7 的值是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"19"},{"id":"b","text":"5"},{"id":"c","text":"−5"},{"id":"d","text":"−19"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"4 × (−3) + 7 = −12 + 7 = −5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"比 x 的 3 倍多 2 的数，可以表示为 3x + 2。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"先取 x 的 3 倍得到 3x，再多 2，得到 3x + 2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"当 a = −2、b = 3 时，2a + 3b 的值是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"13"},{"id":"b","text":"5"},{"id":"c","text":"−5"},{"id":"d","text":"−13"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"2 × (−2) + 3 × 3 = −4 + 9 = 5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"大盒装 10 支笔，小盒装 4 支笔。a 个大盒和 b 个小盒共装多少支笔？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"14ab"},{"id":"b","text":"10b + 4a"},{"id":"c","text":"14(a + b)"},{"id":"d","text":"10a + 4b"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"大盒共 10a 支，小盒共 4b 支，总数为 10a + 4b。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"当 y = 4 时，下列结果中哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"y − 1 = 3"},{"id":"b","text":"3y = 12"},{"id":"c","text":"y² = 8"},{"id":"d","text":"y/2 = 2"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"代入得 3、12、16、2，C 的平方算成了乘 2，故 A、B、D 正确。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"数量关系表达","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"买 3 个每个 y 元的文件袋和 1 块 2 元的橡皮，付款 15 元且足够支付，应找回多少元？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"15 − 3y + 2"},{"id":"b","text":"13 − 3y"},{"id":"c","text":"15 − 5y"},{"id":"d","text":"3y − 13"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"总价为 3y + 2，找零为 15 − (3y + 2) = 13 − 3y。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"字母意义","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"在同一个代数式 x + x² 中，两处 x 表示同一个数。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"同一表达式中的同一字母含义一致，求值时两处必须代入相同数值。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-expressions-r10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-expressions","capabilityTag":"代数式求值","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"当 b = −3 时，下列求值结果中哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−b = −3"},{"id":"b","text":"b² = 9"},{"id":"c","text":"b³ = −27"},{"id":"d","text":"2b = −6"}],"correctAnswer":["b","c","d"],"explanation":"−b 应为 3；(−3)² = 9，(−3)³ = −27，2 × (−3) = −6。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"g7u-c3-polynomials","subject":"数学","grade":7,"semester":"上册","textbookVersion":"北师大版","chapterId":"g7u-chapter-3","title":"认识单项式、多项式与同类项","lessonId":"g7-upper-algebra","learningMode":"explanation","capabilityTags":["单项式认识","多项式认识","同类项辨析"],
      "learningGuide":{"steps":["数与字母的乘积叫单项式，单独一个数或字母也是单项式。数因数是系数，字母指数之和是次数。","如 −3x²y 的系数是 −3，次数为 2 + 1 = 3；−x 的系数是 −1。非零常数单项式的次数是 0。","几个单项式的和叫多项式，每个单项式连同前面的符号是一项；次数取各项次数中的最大值。","同类项要求所含字母相同，而且相同字母的指数也相同；系数可以不同，字母书写顺序不影响是否同类。"],"pitfalls":["系数包含符号，−x 的系数不是 1。","单项式次数是字母指数之和，多项式次数不是各项次数之和。","x²y 与 xy² 不是同类项；1/x 的字母在分母中，不是整式。"]},
      "questions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"单项式 −5x 的系数是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"5"},{"id":"b","text":"−5"},{"id":"c","text":"1"},{"id":"d","text":"−1"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"系数是单项式的数因数，必须连同符号，所以为 −5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"单项式 x²y 的次数是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"1"},{"id":"b","text":"2"},{"id":"c","text":"4"},{"id":"d","text":"3"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"x 的指数是 2，y 的指数是 1，次数为 2 + 1 = 3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"单独一个数 7 也是单项式。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"单独一个数或字母也是单项式；非零常数 7 的次数为 0。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"多项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"多项式 3x² − 2x + 5 有几项？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3"},{"id":"b","text":"2"},{"id":"c","text":"4"},{"id":"d","text":"5"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"三项分别是 3x²、−2x、5，每项保留前面的符号。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"多项式认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"多项式 2a³ − 4ab + 1 的次数是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2"},{"id":"b","text":"5"},{"id":"c","text":"3"},{"id":"d","text":"6"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"三项次数为 3、2、0，最高为 3，所以该多项式是三次多项式。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"多项式认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"多项式 x² + x²y 的次数是 2 + 3 = 5。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"多项式次数取各项次数的最大值，不求和，因此次数为 3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列式子中，哪些是单项式？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3x"},{"id":"b","text":"−2"},{"id":"c","text":"1/x"},{"id":"d","text":"x + 1"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b"],"explanation":"3x 是数与字母的乘积，−2 是常数单项式；1/x 字母在分母，x + 1 为两项之和。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"关于单项式 −x²y，哪项描述正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"系数为 1，次数为 2"},{"id":"b","text":"系数为 −1，次数为 3"},{"id":"c","text":"系数为 −2，次数为 3"},{"id":"d","text":"系数为 −1，次数为 2"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"−x²y = (−1) × x² × y，系数 −1，字母指数和为 3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"同类项辨析","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列各项中，哪些与 2ab² 是同类项？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−3ab²"},{"id":"b","text":"b²a"},{"id":"c","text":"2a²b"},{"id":"d","text":"5ab"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b"],"explanation":"同类项需要 a 的指数为 1、b 的指数为 2；A、B 满足，系数和字母书写顺序不影响。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"n 为非负整数。若单项式 −4xⁿy² 的次数为 5，则 n 是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2"},{"id":"b","text":"5"},{"id":"c","text":"7"},{"id":"d","text":"3"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"单项式次数为 n + 2，n + 2 = 5，所以 n = 3。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ],
      "retestQuestions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"单项式 −8y 的系数是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"8"},{"id":"b","text":"−1"},{"id":"c","text":"−8"},{"id":"d","text":"1"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"数因数连同负号为 −8，所以系数是 −8。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"单项式 a²b³ 的次数是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"5"},{"id":"b","text":"3"},{"id":"c","text":"2"},{"id":"d","text":"6"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"单项式次数为所有字母指数之和，2 + 3 = 5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"单项式 z 的系数和次数都是 1。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"z = 1 × z¹，因此系数为 1，次数也为 1。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"多项式认识","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"多项式 4y³ − y² + 2y − 6 有几项？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2"},{"id":"b","text":"3"},{"id":"c","text":"6"},{"id":"d","text":"4"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"四项是 4y³、−y²、2y、−6，常数项也算一项。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"多项式认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"多项式 5x²y² − 3x + 7 的次数是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2"},{"id":"b","text":"4"},{"id":"c","text":"5"},{"id":"d","text":"7"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"第一项次数为 2 + 2 = 4，其余项为 1 和 0，最大值为 4。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"多项式认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"多项式 2x³ − 5 的常数项是 −5。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"项要连同前面的符号一起看，不含字母的项为 −5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列式子中，哪些是整式？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"4m²"},{"id":"b","text":"m − 2"},{"id":"c","text":"2/m"},{"id":"d","text":"−9"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"整式包括单项式和多项式；A、D 为单项式，B 为多项式，C 的字母在分母中，不是整式。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"关于单项式 −ab³，哪项描述正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"系数为 −1，次数为 4"},{"id":"b","text":"系数为 1，次数为 4"},{"id":"c","text":"系数为 −3，次数为 3"},{"id":"d","text":"系数为 −1，次数为 3"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"系数是省略的 −1，次数为 a 的指数 1 加 b 的指数 3，等于 4。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"同类项辨析","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列各项中，哪些与 −4x²y 是同类项？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−4xy²"},{"id":"b","text":"7x²y"},{"id":"c","text":"yx²"},{"id":"d","text":"x²"}],"correctAnswer":["b","c"],"explanation":"同类项必须含 x² 和 y，B、C 满足；A 的指数对应不同，D 缺少 y。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-polynomials-r10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-polynomials","capabilityTag":"单项式认识","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"m 为非负整数。若单项式 6a²bᵐ 的次数为 6，则 m 是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2"},{"id":"b","text":"3"},{"id":"c","text":"4"},{"id":"d","text":"8"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"次数为 2 + m，2 + m = 6，所以 m = 4。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"g7u-c3-simplify","subject":"数学","grade":7,"semester":"上册","textbookVersion":"北师大版","chapterId":"g7u-chapter-3","title":"去括号、合并同类项与整式加减","lessonId":"g7-upper-algebra","learningMode":"explanation","capabilityTags":["合并同类项","去括号","整式加减与求值"],
      "learningGuide":{"steps":["先辨认同类项：字母及其指数对应相同才可合并。合并时只把系数相加，字母部分不变。","括号前是加号，去括号后各项符号不变；括号前是减号，各项符号都要改变。","有数乘括号时，先用分配律乘到每一项，再合并同类项。如 2(x − 3) + x = 2x − 6 + x = 3x − 6。","求整式和差时先把各整式用括号括起，再去括号、合并同类项。求值优先化简，可以减少重复计算。"],"pitfalls":["3x + 5x = 8x，不是 8x²。","−(a − b) = −a + b，不能只改变第一项的符号。","不同类项如 2x 与 3y 不能直接合并成 5xy。"]},
      "questions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 3x + 5x。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"8x²"},{"id":"b","text":"15x"},{"id":"c","text":"8x"},{"id":"d","text":"2x"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"只把系数相加，3 + 5 = 8，字母部分 x 不变，得到 8x。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 7a − 2a。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"5a"},{"id":"b","text":"9a"},{"id":"c","text":"5"},{"id":"d","text":"14a²"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"系数相减，(7 − 2)a = 5a。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"x + x = 2x，而不是 x²。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"两个 x 相加是 2x；x² 表示 x 与 x 相乘。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"去括号","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"去括号后，−(x − 3) 等于什么？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−x − 3"},{"id":"b","text":"x + 3"},{"id":"c","text":"x − 3"},{"id":"d","text":"−x + 3"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"括号前为负号，括号内两项都变号：x 变为 −x，−3 变为 +3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"整式加减与求值","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 4x + 3 − 2x + 5。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"6x + 8"},{"id":"b","text":"2x + 8"},{"id":"c","text":"2x − 2"},{"id":"d","text":"10x"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"字母项 4x − 2x = 2x，常数项 3 + 5 = 8，结果为 2x + 8。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"去括号","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 2(a − 3) + a。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3a − 3"},{"id":"b","text":"2a − 6"},{"id":"c","text":"3a − 6"},{"id":"d","text":"3a + 6"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"先分配得 2a − 6 + a，再合并为 3a − 6。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列合并同类项的结果中，哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2x + 3x = 5x"},{"id":"b","text":"2a + 3b = 5ab"},{"id":"c","text":"x² + x² = 2x²"},{"id":"d","text":"5y − y = 4y"}],"correctAnswer":["a","c","d"],"explanation":"A、C、D 只合并系数，字母部分不变；B 中 a 与 b 不同类，不能合并。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"整式加减与求值","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"当 x = −2 时，3(x − 1) − 2(x + 4) 的值是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−13"},{"id":"b","text":"−9"},{"id":"c","text":"9"},{"id":"d","text":"13"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"化简为 3x − 3 − 2x − 8 = x − 11；代入 −2，得 −13。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"去括号","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"对任意有理数 a、b，a − (b − 2) = a − b − 2。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"括号前负号使两项都变号，正确结果为 a − b + 2。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"整式加减与求值","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"设 A = 2x + 3，B = x − 5，下列结果中哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"A + B = 3x − 2"},{"id":"b","text":"A − B = x + 8"},{"id":"c","text":"B − A = −x + 8"},{"id":"d","text":"2A = 4x + 6"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"相加得 3x − 2；相减得 x + 8；B − A = −x − 8，故 C 错；2A = 4x + 6。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ],
      "retestQuestions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 4y + 6y。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"10y²"},{"id":"b","text":"10y"},{"id":"c","text":"24y"},{"id":"d","text":"2y"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"(4 + 6)y = 10y，合并时字母的指数不改变。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 9b − 4b。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"13b"},{"id":"b","text":"5"},{"id":"c","text":"36b²"},{"id":"d","text":"5b"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"系数 9 − 4 = 5，字母部分仍为 b。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"2m + 3n 可以合并为 5mn。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"m 与 n 不是相同字母，两项不同类，不能直接合并。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"去括号","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"去括号后，−(y + 4) 等于什么？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"−y − 4"},{"id":"b","text":"−y + 4"},{"id":"c","text":"y − 4"},{"id":"d","text":"y + 4"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"括号前负号使 y 和 +4 都变号，得到 −y − 4。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"整式加减与求值","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 5y − 2 − 3y + 7。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"8y + 5"},{"id":"b","text":"2y − 9"},{"id":"c","text":"2y + 5"},{"id":"d","text":"7y"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"5y − 3y = 2y，−2 + 7 = 5，所以为 2y + 5。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"去括号","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"化简 3(b − 2) − b。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2b − 2"},{"id":"b","text":"2b − 6"},{"id":"c","text":"4b − 6"},{"id":"d","text":"2b + 6"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"先得 3b − 6 − b，再合并成 2b − 6。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"合并同类项","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"下列化简中，哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"6a − 2a = 4a"},{"id":"b","text":"3x² − x² = 2x²"},{"id":"c","text":"x + x² = 2x³"},{"id":"d","text":"7b − b = 6b"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"A、B、D 合并的是同类项；C 中 x 和 x² 的次数不同，不能合并。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"整式加减与求值","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"当 y = 3 时，4(y − 2) − 3(y + 1) 的值是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"8"},{"id":"b","text":"14"},{"id":"c","text":"−14"},{"id":"d","text":"−8"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"化简为 4y − 8 − 3y − 3 = y − 11；代入 3 得 −8。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"去括号","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"对任意有理数 a、b，a − (b + 3) = a − b − 3。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"负号作用于括号内每一项，所以 b 变为 −b，+3 变为 −3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-simplify-r10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-simplify","capabilityTag":"整式加减与求值","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"设 P = 3y − 2，Q = y + 4，下列结果中哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"P + Q = 4y + 2"},{"id":"b","text":"P − Q = 2y + 2"},{"id":"c","text":"Q − P = −2y + 6"},{"id":"d","text":"2Q = 2y + 8"}],"correctAnswer":["a","c","d"],"explanation":"P + Q = 4y + 2；P − Q = 2y − 6，故 B 错；Q − P = −2y + 6；2Q = 2y + 8。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ]
    },
    {
      "id":"g7u-c3-patterns","subject":"数学","grade":7,"semester":"上册","textbookVersion":"北师大版","chapterId":"g7u-chapter-3","title":"探索并用代数式表达规律","lessonId":"g7-upper-algebra","learningMode":"explanation","capabilityTags":["变化规律","数量规律表达","规律验证"],
      "learningGuide":{"steps":["先明确编号 n 从 1 开始，以及题目给出的重复规则；不要只凭几个数就断言唯一规律。","每次增加固定的 d 时，第 n 项 = 第一项 + (n − 1)d。例：第一项为 4，每次加 3，第 n 项为 3n + 1。","计数先找第一步数量，再分析每增加一步真正新增多少。共用的边或位置不能重复计算。","把 n = 1、2 及一个较大值代入验证，再依据题目给定的构造规则说明为什么成立；只验证几个值不能证明任意规律。"],"pitfalls":["第一步之后只增加了 n − 1 次，不是 n 次。","横排相邻正方形共用一条边时，每增加一个只新增 3 根火柴。","只有有限几个数且未给规则时，后续项并不唯一；按明确规则作答才可靠。"]},
      "questions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"变化规律","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一列数第一项是 3，以后每项都比前一项大 4。第四项是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"11"},{"id":"b","text":"12"},{"id":"c","text":"15"},{"id":"d","text":"19"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"依次为 3、7、11、15，所以第四项为 15。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"第 n 个正奇数是多少？其中 n 从 1 开始。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2n − 1"},{"id":"b","text":"2n"},{"id":"c","text":"2n + 1"},{"id":"d","text":"n + 1"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"正奇数为 1、3、5……，第一项为 1，每次加 2，所以第 n 项为 1 + 2(n − 1) = 2n − 1。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"每盒装 6 支笔，n 盒共装 6n 支笔。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"true","explanation":"每盒数量固定，用 6 乘盒数 n，得到总数 6n。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"规律验证","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"已知第 n 项由 5n + 2 给出，n 从 1 开始。第二项是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"7"},{"id":"b","text":"10"},{"id":"c","text":"14"},{"id":"d","text":"12"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"把 n = 2 代入，5 × 2 + 2 = 12。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"用火柴横排搭 n 个相同的正方形，相邻两正方形只共用一条边，不重叠，每条边用 1 根火柴。共需多少根？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"4n"},{"id":"b","text":"3n + 1"},{"id":"c","text":"3n − 1"},{"id":"d","text":"n + 3"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"第一个需 4 根，以后每个新增 3 根，共 4 + 3(n − 1) = 3n + 1 根。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"变化规律","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"礼堂第一排有 12 个座位，此后每排比前一排多 2 个。第 n 排有多少个座位？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"12 + 2n"},{"id":"b","text":"12n"},{"id":"c","text":"2n + 10"},{"id":"d","text":"2n − 10"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"第 n 排比第一排增加了 n − 1 次，总数为 12 + 2(n − 1) = 2n + 10。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"规律验证","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"一列数的第 n 项规定为 3n − 2，n 从 1 开始。下列说法哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"第一项是 1"},{"id":"b","text":"第三项是 7"},{"id":"c","text":"每后一项比前一项大 3"},{"id":"d","text":"第五项是 15"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","c"],"explanation":"代入 n = 1、3、5 得 1、7、13；n 每增加 1，3n − 2 增加 3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d08","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一列数第一项为 2，此后每项都是前一项的 3 倍。第四项是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"54"},{"id":"b","text":"18"},{"id":"c","text":"24"},{"id":"d","text":"162"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"依次为 2、6、18、54；从第一项到第四项共乘 3 三次。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d09","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"规律验证","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"只知道一列数的前三项是 2、4、6，没有给出生成规则，就能断定第四项一定是 8。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"8 是按每次加 2 推测的结果；仅凭前三项不能确定唯一生成规则，必须有额外条件。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-d10","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"challenge","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"一列数第一项是 5，以后每项比前一项大 4。n 从 1 开始，下列式子哪些都能表示第 n 项？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"5 + 4(n − 1)"},{"id":"b","text":"4n + 1"},{"id":"c","text":"5 + 4n"},{"id":"d","text":"4(n + 1) − 3"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"第一项加 n − 1 次增量得 5 + 4(n − 1) = 4n + 1；D 化简也等于 4n + 1，C 多加了一次。","source":"local-reviewed"}
      ],
      "retestQuestions":[
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-r01","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"变化规律","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"一列数第一项是 5，此后每项比前一项大 3。第五项是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"14"},{"id":"b","text":"17"},{"id":"c","text":"20"},{"id":"d","text":"15"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"从第一项到第五项增加四次，5 + 4 × 3 = 17。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-r02","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"第 n 个正偶数是多少？其中 n 从 1 开始。","options":[{"id":"a","text":"2n − 1"},{"id":"b","text":"n + 1"},{"id":"c","text":"2n + 2"},{"id":"d","text":"2n"}],"correctAnswer":"d","explanation":"正偶数为 2、4、6……，第 n 项是 2 + 2(n − 1) = 2n。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-r03","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"true-false","prompt":"每包有 8 张卡纸，n 包共有 n + 8 张卡纸。","options":[{"id":"true","text":"正确"},{"id":"false","text":"错误"}],"correctAnswer":"false","explanation":"应把每包数量乘包数，得到 8n 张，而不是相加。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-r04","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"规律验证","difficulty":"basic","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"已知第 n 项由 4n + 3 给出，n 从 1 开始。第三项是多少？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"15"},{"id":"b","text":"12"},{"id":"c","text":"19"},{"id":"d","text":"7"}],"correctAnswer":"a","explanation":"把 n = 3 代入，4 × 3 + 3 = 15。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-r05","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"数量规律表达","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"用火柴搭三角形：第一个用 3 根，以后每增加一个三角形只与已有图形共用一条完整边，因此每次新增 2 根。搭 n 个共需多少根？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"3n"},{"id":"b","text":"2n − 1"},{"id":"c","text":"2n + 1"},{"id":"d","text":"n + 2"}],"correctAnswer":"c","explanation":"共需 3 + 2(n − 1) = 2n + 1 根；题目已规定每次只新增 2 根。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-r06","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"变化规律","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"single-choice","prompt":"展架第一层放 9 件作品，此后每层比前一层多 3 件。第 n 层放多少件？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"9 + 3n"},{"id":"b","text":"3n + 6"},{"id":"c","text":"9n"},{"id":"d","text":"3n − 6"}],"correctAnswer":"b","explanation":"第一层 9 件，到第 n 层增加 n − 1 次，9 + 3(n − 1) = 3n + 6。","source":"local-reviewed"},
        {"id":"g7u-c3-patterns-r07","knowledgePointId":"g7u-c3-patterns","capabilityTag":"规律验证","difficulty":"advanced","responseType":"multi-choice","prompt":"一列数的第 n 项规定为 2n + 3，n 从 1 开始。下列说法哪些正确？","options":[{"id":"a","text":"第一项是 5"},{"id":"b","text":"第四项是 11"},{"id":"c","text":"每后一项比前一项大 3"},{"id":"d","text":"第五项是 13"}],"correctAnswer":["a","b","d"],"explanation":"代入 1、4、5 得 5、11、13；n 每增加 1，该式增加 2，不是 3。","source":"local-reviewed"},
